+  - Instrumented `/readyz` to record one readiness observation per configured dependency gate on each probe.
+  - Exposed the readiness snapshot from `GET /metrics` under `data.readiness_degradation` and documented the operator incident workflow.
+  - Marked BE-0373 passing in `ralph/prd.json`.
